    <div class="wrap story">
      <div class="label" style="padding-top:8px">[ Our story ]</div>
      <div class="text">
        <p class="fx">We started RavensOrbit after watching the same thing happen across brand after brand. Money going into ads. Traffic coming to the website. And customers falling away somewhere between the first click and the second purchase.</p>
        <p class="fx muted">Nobody was doing a bad job. The problem was that each part of the marketing was owned by a different team or vendor, measured differently, and rarely discussed together.</p>
        <p class="fx">We also saw something else. Big names were losing ground to smaller local players. Not because the product was worse, but because the local audience didn't believe the brand would show up for them. <span class="mark reset" data-mark>A strong name globally doesn't automatically earn trust locally.</span></p>
        <p class="fx muted">So we built an agency that treats brand and growth as one job. We look at the full journey, from the first time someone hears about you to the tenth time they buy, and make each part support the next.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
